                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week, I testified before the @EdWorkforceCmte about my bill, the #SafeStepAct, which provides guardrails for patients to make sure health insurance companies follow a clear process that allows patients to get their needed medication. Thank you, @virginiafoxx for allowing me to discuss this bipartisan legislation.",
