                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Relying on foreign adversaries like China for basic medical supplies not only threatens the lives of our service members but also threatens the health spans of all Americans. \n\nAt a @waysandmeansGOP hearing yesterday, I spoke about the importance of manufacturing these items here at home.",
