                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I enjoyed my visit with @TriHealth and touring Good Samaritan Hospital's phenomenal facilities, including their free health clinic, food pantry, and College of Nursing and Health Science. \n\nWe had a fruitful discussion on investments in behavioral health and preparing our future health care workers for success.",
