                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This week is National Salute to Veteran Patients Week. As a physician, lawmaker, and veteran, I am proud of the work we have done so far to improve the health care veterans receive every day, and I am committed to ensuring all of our nation's veterans get the care they deserve. https://t.co/hvIwUlYOku",
