                "text": "Dangerous DEI Ideology is infiltrating American medical schools, threatening the health spans of all Americans.\n\nI joined my friend and fellow physician, @RepGregMurphy on H.R. 7725, a bill to bar Federal funding from flowing to medical schools that practice this harmful discriminatory ideology.\n\nRead more on the dangers of DEI in medicine from my op-ed here: https://t.co/PpWTIO65UM",
