                "text": "We rely on China for too many of our health care supplies - ranging from personal protective equipment to the vital prescriptions Americans use every day. \n\nIt's critical that our trade policies match the goal of securing our critical supply chains. \n\nI raised my concerns with @AmbassadorTai at this week's @WaysandMeansGOP hearing.",
